@database usb-poseidon.guide
@$VER: usb-poseidon.guide 1.0 (29.9.2026)

@node Main "ZZ9000 USB - Poseidon hardware driver"
@{b}zzusbhw.device@{ub} connects the MNT ZZ9000 EHCI host controller to the
commercial Poseidon 4.5 USB stack (https://www.platon42.de/en/poseidon/) on
AmigaOS. Poseidon and its class files are external prerequisites; this
package does not replace or modify them.

