@node building-from-source-developers "Building from source (developers)"

cd usb-poseidon
./build.sh          # uses the m68k-amigaos Docker toolchain

Produces @{b}zzusbhw.device@{ub}. For a normal Amiga test, copy it to
@{b}DEVS:USBHardware/@{ub} and point Poseidon at it via the Trident steps above. For
a release, CI places the driver in the installer drawer so the Commodore
Installer can copy it to @{b}DEVS:USBHardware/@{ub}.

@{"Contents" link Main}

@endnode

